# AI Memory System - Fuguku Project

description: Permanent memory system to prevent basic mistakes and ensure consistent quality in WordPress development. Contains mandatory checklists, zero tolerance rules, and workflow templates that must be followed for every update.

globs:
  - "**/*.php"
  - "**/*.css"
  - "**/*.js"
  - "**/*.md"
alwaysApply: true

---

## 🧠 PERMANENT MEMORY RULES

### 🚨 MANDATORY CHECKS (Setiap Update):
1. **Plugin Version Update**
   - Update version number
   - Update timestamp (HH:MM)
   - Update description
   - Update version history

2. **Project Rules Sync**
   - Update current version
   - Update last updated timestamp
   - Update description
   - Update version history

3. **Testing Requirements**
   - Test feature di staging site
   - Verify functionality works
   - Konfirmasi dengan user sebelum mengklaim selesai

### ❌ ZERO TOLERANCE (Jangan Lupa):
- JANGAN PERNAH MENGKLAIM SELESAI tanpa testing
- JANGAN LUPA update version + timestamp
- JANGAN LUPA update project rules
- JANGAN LUPA test di staging site

### ✅ ALWAYS REMEMBER:
- User sudah bayar mahal
- Kepercayaan user sudah menurun
- Setiap kesalahan kecil = kepercayaan turun
- Quality over speed
- Test before claim
- Confirm with user

### 📋 TEMPLATE FOR UPDATES:
```php
/**
 * Version: X.X.X
 * Last Updated: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM
 * Description: [Update description]
 * Version History:
 * vX.X.X - [What was changed]
 */
```

### 🔄 WORKFLOW:
1. Make changes
2. Update plugin version + timestamp
3. Update project rules
4. Test di staging
5. Commit with meaningful message
6. Push to staging
7. Verify di staging site
8. Konfirmasi dengan user

### 🎯 SUCCESS METRICS:
- ✅ User puas dengan hasil
- ✅ Tidak ada kesalahan dasar
- ✅ Fitur berfungsi dengan baik
- ✅ Version + timestamp selalu update
- ✅ Project rules selalu sync

## 🔒 Pre-Push Guardrails (Large Files & Shadow Dirs)

### Kenapa ini wajib
- Insiden 2025-10-08: Push gagal (HTTP 500) karena accidental tracked folder berukuran ~2GB: `wp-content 2/uploads/` (shadow duplicate dari `wp-content/uploads/`).
- `.gitignore` awal hanya mengabaikan `wp-content/uploads/`, tidak meng-cover shadow folder/duplikat (contoh: `wp-content 2/`).
- Solusi permanen: enforce policy ini sebelum setiap push.

### Hard Rules (Zero Tolerance)
- ❌ JANGAN PERNAH commit atau push:
  - Direktori uploads apapun: `wp-content/uploads/`, `wp-content 2/uploads/`, atau pola `wp-content */uploads/`
  - Arsip & dump: `*.zip`, `*.gz`, `*.sql`, `*.sql.gz`, `*.bak`, `*.backup`
- ✅ SELALU stage file secara eksplisit: `git add <file-path-yang-diedit-saja>`
- ✅ Jika perlu ambil perubahan dari commit lama, gunakan surgical restore: `git checkout <commit> -- <path>` lalu commit baru, BUKAN cherry-pick besar yang bisa menarik file tak diinginkan.

### Wajib di .gitignore (root)
Tambahkan (atau pastikan ada):

```
# Duplicate/shadow directories (Finder copies, etc.)
wp-content 2/

# Uploads directories (any variant should never be tracked)
wp-content/uploads/

# Large archives & dumps
*.zip
*.gz
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.bak
*.backup
```

### Pre-push Checklist (Jalankan SEMUA perintah ini)
```
# 1) Lihat apa yang akan dipush dibanding remote
git status -s
git diff --name-only origin/masterstaging..HEAD

# 2) Deteksi berkas/dir terlarang (uploads, arsip, dumps)
git ls-files 'wp-content */uploads/**' '*.zip' '*.gz' '*.sql' '*.sql.gz' '*.bak' '*.backup'

# 3) Cek ukuran file yang distage (>10MB akan diblok)
git diff --cached --name-only | while read p; do \
  if [ -f "$p" ]; then sz=$(wc -c <"$p"); \
    if [ $sz -gt 10485760 ]; then echo ">10MB: $p ($sz bytes)"; fi; \
  fi; \
done

# 4) Jika ada output dari langkah (2) atau (3), STOP
#    Unstage dan revert file terlarang/besar
#    Contoh:
#    git restore --staged "wp-content 2/uploads/..."
#    git reset -- "*.zip"
```

### Strategi Commit Aman (Surgical)
- Stage hanya file yang diminta user (path spesifik), misal:
```
git add wp-content/themes/claue-child/functions.php \
        wp-content/themes/claue-child/style.css \
        wp-content/themes/claue-child/woocommerce/content-product.php \
        wp-content/themes/claue-child/woocommerce/content-product-image.php
```
- Jika commit lama ikut membawa file besar/terlarang, JANGAN cherry-pick mentah. Gunakan:
```
git checkout <commit> -- <paths-yang-valid-saja>
git commit -m "feat(theme): apply intended edits only"
```

### Incident Note (2025-10-08)
- Penyebab: Shadow folder `wp-content 2/uploads/` ter-track → pack ~2GB → push HTTP 500.
- Perbaikan: Tambah ignore `wp-content 2/`, dorong policy pre-push ini, dan hanya push file tema anak yang diubah.
- Preventive: Wajib jalankan Pre-push Checklist di atas, commit surgikal saja.
